Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,--
(a)
"Act" means the National Environment Appellate Authority Act, 1997 (
22 of 1997
);
(b)
"Authority" means the National Environment Appellate Authority established under sub-section (1) of Section 3 of the
Act;
(c)
"Chairperson" means the Chairperson of the Authority;
(d)
"Vice-Chairperson" means the Vice-Chairperson of the Authority;
